+* :class:`py2:urllib2.HTTPDigestAuthHandler`
+* :class:`py2:urllib2.ProxyDigestAuthHandler`
+* :class:`py2:urllib2.HTTPHandler`
+* :class:`py2:urllib2.HTTPSHandler`
